    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">This output aims to understand and improve the existing regulatory frameworks and governance structures that guide the management of Community Nature Reserves (RNCs) and Pastoral Units (UPs). The objective is to identify weaknesses, risks, and opportunities, and to propose strategies that strengthen community-based management of these areas. Special attention will be given to ensuring that women and youth are not only represented in governance structures but are also empowered to actively engage in decision-making processes.</narrative>
    </description>
